  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elaŋa nawu, Neyi muntu wukuseŋa iŋodindi, niyena hakufuma kudiyena, hakwikala wamu ntu wacheŋi, iyala akamufunu tilinawa cheŋi? Ituŋa hiyakasweja kuditamishaku? Ilaŋa eyi wunakoŋi wuvumbi nawatujilatwa eyi amavulu. Hela chochu, funtenu kudami. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fumbu laku mesu eyi wutali kuyinaŋa anaŋa ayankumbu. Kudihikunabuli kukamawu neyi? Wayi shakaminaŋa akunjila neyi chelaŋa ayi kaArabiya mwisaŋa. Wuna tamishi dehi ituŋa nawuvumbi weyi nakutamakweyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chanalekesheluwu nvula jawowo, ninvula yankumini nakuhikwosi. Hela chochu, ihama deyi dawuvumbi hohu, kwonti kweyi kutiyansonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha hanu hiwuku ndilila neyi, Eyi tata, yeyi nlomboli yahawansi wamuku, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azuwaŋa tuhu kwindi zuwe-e, tahindi? Akake lumu tuhu kwindi ndo nikunsa? Tiya, eyi wu neli nikuhosha nikwilyuma yatama, wuneli mwamuchima weyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wa ŋilili nawa mumafuku amwanta Yosiya, nindi, Wunamoni chaneliyi Isarela mukwakuselumukila hanyima, tahindi? Yena nakanduki hampidi jajilehi jejima, nayi mumashina anyitondu yitu uta yejima, nakwililakuwuvumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliliyi nakoŋi dehi yuma yejimiyi, ami hinukwila nami, Wukufunta cheŋi kudami. Aka, kufunta kwindi nehi. Nimana kwindi Yuda, mukwakukwatila akwawu makasu, wachimweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami namweniche liliyi Isarela mukwakuselumukila hanyima, liohansaŋu yoyeniyi nakoŋi dehi wuvumbi, ninami nawa namuleki dehi, namwinki dehi mukanda wakumuseŋa anachu, mana kwindi Yuda, mukwakukwatila akwawu makasu, hatiyili womaku. Niyena nawa hakuya nakwila wu vumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliliwuvumbi windi wuna sweji dehi, niituŋa dinatami dehi, yena hakwilawu vumbi namalola nanyitondu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela tuhu mwejim imu mana kwindi Yuda, mukwakukwatila akwawu makasu, hanafunti cheŋi kudami namuchima windiwe jimaku, nafunti chakutwamba hohu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakuŋala nindi, Isarela, mukwakuselumukila hanyima, nadimwekeshiku loŋa akwakubadika Yuda, mukwakukwatila akwawu makasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaku wakabidiki mazu awa chakutala kukabeta kakuchimunswa, neyi, Yehova nindi, Eyi Isarela, mukwakuselumukila hanyima, funtaku, amihinakakutala nakuzuwaku, muloŋa ami nikweti luwi. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. Cheŋa nawa nindi, Ami hinakazuwa zuwe-e-ku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa dinu chiŋa witija kuluwa kweyi kuwunamumotoki Yehova Nzambi yeyi, nichiwuna mwaŋelimu majila e yi akuya kudi antu akwacheŋa mwahita nyitonduyituuta yejima, ninichi chiwunabuli kwovwahila izu dami. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Enu anyana mwaselu mukilaŋa hanyima, funtenu, muloŋa ami ninfumwenu, ninami nakayinonojola, hamukala ahaninonahu wumu, hachisaka aha ninonahu yedi, nakayileta kuZiyona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayinka nitu biŋa twamwaya muchima wami, akayidi ishaŋa nikwilukanikashinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Chimwakela munavuli dehi, munasemununi dehi mwituŋa, mumafuku owu himwakahosha nawa cheŋa nenu, Chimba ŋucha chiti yaloŋa enu chaYehova ku, hichakenza nikumu chimaku, nikuchanukanawa nehi, himwa kayaloŋa nikwoku, mwenomu hiyamba kelamu nawacheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku owu akatena Yerusalema nawu, hiitanda daYehova dawanta. Kwakapompela nyuza yejima, yakapompela kwijina daYehova, kuYerusalema. Hiyakenda nawa cheŋi mwaya kuchinchika kwanyi chima yawu yatamaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena mafuku owu mutaŋa waYuda wakendaŋa hamuna mutaŋa waIsarela, akafuma kwituŋa dakukabeta kakuchimunswa, akenjilahamu kwituŋa dinenkeli ankakulula jenu kudiswana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa ami nelili nami, Nuku kusha ŋahi mukachi kawanyana, nikwinki ituŋa dikwetini chipepa, wowu wuswana wawuwahi wadiŋa wamazaza anyuza? Nelili nami, Mwakantenaŋa nenu, Tata; nami mwakabuli kulekakunlonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalala kwaamu, mwakwatilaŋa ayi mumbanda nifumwindi makasu hakufuma kudi yena, dimu mumunankwa tili makasu ninami, enu akwamutaŋa waIsarela. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izudidi nakuti yakana hayinaŋa anaŋa yankumbu, dakudila nakulemba kwadi nakulembawu anyana kaIsarela; muloŋa anaheŋeshi dehi mwela ŋawu, anavulameni dehi Yehova Nzambi yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu anyana mwaselu mukilaŋa hanyima, funtenu, nukuyuka kuselumuka kwenu kumwaselu mukilaŋa hanyima. Tiya, tunenzidehi kudeyi; muloŋa eyi yeyi Yehova Nzambi yetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalala mpidŋa mukunkulwa yi, nimpidi jamaneni jinavulituhu; chalala wamwinu waIsarela wudi mudi Yehova Nzambi yetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa kufumisha kuwansi wetu nsonyi yadyaloŋa yuma yakabakenuwu ankakulula jetu, niyimu nayawuyanyanya, niyimunayawu yamaneni, ni anyanawu amayala, nianyanawu awambanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tu kumini dakukambama kwanansonyi yetu, kubaya kwetukutubuti, muloŋa tuna muvulu muni Yehova Nzambi yetu, ninetu niankakulula jetu, kufumisha kuwansi wetu ndo nikwifuku dalelu; hitunovwahili izu daYehova Nzambi yetuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
